{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>無綫戀愛真人騷《女神配對計劃2》掀起全城熱話，參賽者郭珮文舊愛Ice特意跨越半個地球來港求復合，深情舉動一度感 …</p><p></p>\n<p>無綫戀愛真人騷《女神配對計劃2》掀起全城熱話，參賽者郭珮文舊愛Ice特意跨越半個地球來港求復合，深情舉動一度感動無數觀眾。然而昨日他突然在社交平台宣布已經返回美國洛杉磯，惹來大批觀眾猜測其追求行動是否宣告失敗。這段備受矚目感情發展似乎並非如表面般簡單，背後隱藏重重玄機。</p>\n<h2>郭珮文舊愛Ice社交平台帖文揭露最新行蹤</h2>\n<p>昨日Ice突然更新個人社交平台帳戶，上傳多張萬聖節造型照片並以英文發文表示自己已經回到美國洛杉磯。他在帖文中寫道：「I’m dressed as the devil because I’m usually an angel. Halloween is coming up, what are you guy’s costumes going to be?」同時他更邀請追隨者參與無獎問答遊戲，著大家猜測他突然提早離開香港返回洛杉磯背後真正原因。這個突如其來舉動令一直緊貼節目進度觀眾感到非常意外，瞬間成為各大網上討論區熱門話題。</p>\n<h2>當事人Ice大賣關子拒絕交代感情發展進度</h2>\n<p>面對大批網民追問是否已經被淘汰出局，當事人Ice至今仍未有對外作出任何官方說明或正面交代。他在社交平台發文時刻意大賣關子，只表示：「我回LA了，無獎竞猜我為什麼回LA。」即使留言區湧現大量關於他與郭珮文復合進度提問，他依然保持沉默，拒絕透露半點風聲。這種不主動澄清亦不否認態度，令這段跨國追愛故事走向變得更加撲朔迷離，節目製作組方面亦暫時未有就參賽者去留問題發表任何聲明。</p>\n<h2>跨越半個地球參與《女神配對計劃2》求復合</h2>\n<p>回顧這段備受關注感情經歷，Ice當初為了挽回與郭珮文昔日戀情，不惜放下美國生活跨越半個地球來到香港參與《女神配對計劃2》錄影。兩人在節目拍攝期間展現出各種充滿火花互動場面，Ice展現出深情與誠意一度令外界以為他們極有機會愛火重燃。這段跨國情史不僅為節目增加極高討論度，更讓許多觀眾代入其中，期盼兩人能夠順利走到最後並迎來大團圓結局。</p>\n<h2>觀眾化身網絡神探尋找蛛絲馬跡推測賽果</h2>\n<p>大批網民對於Ice突然離港反應兩極，有人直指他可能復合失敗提早出局，留言表示：「為何返了LA，是否出局或Ju沒有和你復合」。不過亦有大批觀眾化身網絡神探，透過相片細節尋找蛛絲馬跡，指出Ice頭上戴著頭飾與郭珮文出席活動時一模一樣，更有人猜測他回美國只是為了執拾行李準備移居香港。有支持者積極留言：「Go to LA and delivery your belongings to HK」，堅信兩人最終能夠修成正果。<br/>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179326524860138365_6764691316ae30e60dbef4.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"l99qx-Bc6MEmR_uQVxYdY5YEV1eAnnq8c8xmw3PMZsM.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179326524860138365_6764691316ae30e60dbef4.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>Ice社交平台帖文揭露最新行蹤（圖片來源：小紅書）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179326525114681662_9565561286ae30e63476c1.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"hr2qnyJO62obSPgqlVvJ8qCLYOtWpoRxDQnUwg0J1MI.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179326525114681662_9565561286ae30e63476c1.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>大賣關子拒絕交代感情發展進度（圖片來源：小紅書）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179326525283498389_298767576ae30e65071b7.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"NhcdyIJbaYAlz4LWJisicWXsLwGhVirz4Q9bduEPW3Y.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179326525283498389_298767576ae30e65071b7.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：小紅書）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179326525488120751_3410808906ae30e670bda2.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"julianakpm_1792989976_4016210928340725205_1400115974.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179326525488120751_3410808906ae30e670bda2.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>Ice頭上戴著頭飾與郭珮文出席活動時一模一樣（圖片來源：IG@julianakpm）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179326525733438557_8942346236ae30e697d4e9.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"julianakpm_1792989977_4016210931813545112_1400115974.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179326525733438557_8942346236ae30e697d4e9.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@julianakpm）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%a5%b3%e7%a5%9e%e9%85%8d%e5%b0%8d%e8%a8%88%e5%8a%832/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">女神配對計劃2</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e6%88%80%e6%84%9b%e7%9c%9f%e4%ba%ba%e9%a8%b7/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">戀愛真人騷</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e9%83%ad%e7%8f%ae%e6%96%87/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">郭珮文</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3532195\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nOct 29 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T10:21:47.642402+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1545,"images":5,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T09:14:28+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T10:58:41.628534+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T10:18:38.837233+00:00","content_hash":"8cc79a2fa0f68c4a1f0a3c15ba8ffe81ce1748e78401ec897e385f4684febc64","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}